===Prepositional phrase===
{{en-PP}}

# {{&lit|en|off|top|head}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} In an [[extemporaneous]] [[manner]]; [[without]] [[careful]] [[thought]], [[preparation]], or [[investigation]].
#: {{syn|en|offhandedly|on the spot}}
#: {{ux|en|I cannot think of any good examples '''off the top of my head''', but give me a couple of hours and I'm sure I could come up with something.}}

====Usage notes====
* Usually used to characterize the manner of one's thinking or speaking.
* Often indicates a random piece of information put forth by a knowledgeable expert in the topic spoken within.

